# Agent models

Unless Vladimir **explicitly** names another model or family in this thread:

- **Implementing agent (main chat):** Grok — see `grok-effort.mdc` for effort and Fast limits.
- **Subagents and reviews:** Composer (`composer-2.5`) — see `agent-review.mdc`.
- **Forbidden by default:** Any other model (e.g. GPT, Claude, Gemini, Muse) and any `*-fast` slug or Fast picker mode.

When spawning Task subagents, choose only Grok (Low/Medium, non-Fast) or `composer-2.5` (non-Fast) per the rules above.

If a task clearly needs another model or Fast, say so once and wait for him to authorize — do not self-escalate.